CVE-2023-49209

# ── esbuild Go stdlib (app/node_modules/esbuild/bin/esbuild) ──────────────────
# esbuild is a build tool (devDependency). Its binary is copied into the image
# by `COPY --from=builder /app/dist` transitively, but it is never executed at
# runtime. The Go stdlib CVEs below affect HTTP/TLS handling inside esbuild's
# built-in dev server, which is not started in production.

